[9.45,"o","\r\n"]
[9.51,"o","  1  Set one up   shows the one line to add\r\n"]
[9.57,"o","  2  Not now      free · advisories and deprecations only, ≈ 27% of the changes in new releases\r\n"]
[9.63,"o","\r\n"]
[9.69,"o","This repo's config suggests Jev + Codex plan: set JEV_API_KEY, install Codex and run `codex login`, then run `unstale setup`.\r\n"]
